# harnesA4 hooks write working state under .harness/ at every session start and tool call; a factory node that
# declares mutates_checkout: false fails if the tree changes under it (seen live 2026-10-24, run 991f5a75), so
# everything under .harness/ is ignored except the files the repo tracks on purpose.
.harness/*
!.harness/tasks.md
!.harness/registry.json
!.harness/entries.json
!.harness/checker-baseline.json
!.harness/harness-manifest.json
!.harness/decisions.json
